# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Activated when CF is wired up.
# Rules are matched top-to-bottom, first match wins.

# --- Blog index pagination — must come BEFORE the legacy /blog/<slug>/ rule.
# /blog/2/.../blog/8/ are real Astro routes; the catch-all below would
# otherwise 301 them to /2/ (404). Self-rewrite (200) consumes the match.
# Extend this list if the blog grows past page 8.
/blog/2/  /blog/2/  200
/blog/3/  /blog/3/  200
/blog/4/  /blog/4/  200
/blog/5/  /blog/5/  200
/blog/6/  /blog/6/  200
/blog/7/  /blog/7/  200
/blog/8/  /blog/8/  200

# --- RSS feeds — WP served /feed/, /blog/feed/, /comments/feed/; the new site
# emits a single /feed.xml. Must come BEFORE the /blog/:slug/ rule, which would
# otherwise catch /blog/feed/ and 301 it to /feed/ (404).
/feed/  /feed.xml  301
/blog/feed/  /feed.xml  301
/comments/feed/  /feed.xml  301

# --- WP-style pagination /blog/page/N/ — the new site paginates at /blog/2/../8/.
# Old /blog/page/9/ etc. have no equivalent. MUST precede /blog/:slug/.
/blog/page/*  /blog/  301

# --- Renamed post whose /blog/:slug/ rewrite would land on a top-level slug
# that doesn't exist (/what-is-zero-party-data/ 404s). Map it directly.
# MUST precede /blog/:slug/.
/blog/what-is-zero-party-data/  /zero-party-data/  301

# Legacy /blog/<slug>/ → /<slug>/ — WP shipped both URLs but always 301'd
# /blog/<slug>/ to /<slug>/. Preserve that behavior so old inbound links still work.
/blog/:slug/  /:slug/  301

# www → apex must be configured in Cloudflare Redirect Rules/Page Rules.
# Cloudflare Workers & Pages validates _redirects with relative URL patterns only.

# Strip AMP — Yoast generated these; never canonical.
/*/amp/  /:splat/  301
/*/amp  /:splat/  301

# WordPress admin/login/XML-RPC paths intentionally have no static routes here,
# so Cloudflare Pages will return its normal 404 for them.

# --- Careers: /jobs/<slug>/ postings moved to top-level routes on the new site.
/jobs/technical-customer-support/  /technical-customer-support/  301
/jobs/marketing-sales-funnel-architect/  /marketing-sales-funnel-architect/  301

# --- /shop/ — Shop-app page retired; send to the Shopify platform page.
/shop/  /product-recommendation-quiz-shopify/  301

# --- Renamed pages — old URLs that map cleanly to a current page.
/privacy-policy/  /privacy/  301
/quiz-templates/  /templates/  301
/integrations/klaviyo  /integrations/  301
/integrations/klaviyo/  /integrations/  301
/try-the-magento-2-product-recommendation-quiz-app-to-boost-your-conversions/  /try-magento-2-product-recommendation-quiz-app-to-boost-your-conversions/  301

# --- Un-migrated WP posts consolidated into the closest live page (301).
/how-to-increase-sales-of-skincare-products-using-a-shopify-quiz-app/  /skincare-quiz-shopify-woocommerce/  301
/sell-skincare-products-better-with-product-recommendation-quiz/  /skincare-quiz-shopify-woocommerce/  301
/transform-your-amazing-ideas-into-a-solid-beauty-business-with-these-proven-tips/  /for-beauty-brands/  301
/product-recommendation-quiz-app-introduces-integration-with-recharge-subscriptions/  /integrations/  301
/the-pivotal-role-of-post-quiz-email-flows-in-ecommerce-a-deep-dive-into-sales-brand-recognition-and-zero-party-data-collection/  /how-to-automate-post-quiz-emails-using-shopify-flows/  301
/new-feature-filter-product-recommendations-by-number-of-votes/  /whats-new/  301
